      "title": "General Office Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | General Office Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us General Office Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260327V Position Title: General Office Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: 6.5 - 7 hours/week Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location St. Augustine Center Detailed Work Schedule Student worker must be available to work from 3:00 or 3:30 to 5:00 at least twice a week. Number of positions: 2 Department: 141-Philosophy Contact Name: Alexandra Penkalskyj Contact Phone/Extension: 94690 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Student office worker responsibilities include phone coverage, scanning and copying, mail sorting, office supply management, and errands, as well as other light duties as needed. Requirements: Student must be dependable, responsible, able to interact with faculty and students. Additional Information: Applications will start to be reviewed on August 19, 2026. Physical Demands Summary: Sitting, manual dexterity in using a copier. Wage Rate: $10.00/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what de