    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36053": {
      "title": "General Office Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | General Office Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us General Office Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260335V Position Title: General Office Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: 10-12 Eligibility: Work Study ONLY Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Dougherty Hall Detailed Work Schedule Hours available to work are Monday through Friday from 9:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. Number of positions: 2 Department: 326-Dean of Students' Office Contact Name: Kathleen Donati Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-4200 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: The Office of the Dean of Students is hiring an undergraduate student office assistant. Duties to include: answering phones, greeting students and parents and other tasks as needed. Extremely confidential office. Requirements: Strong interpersonal skills are required and the ability to work in a professional, fast paced, and confidential setting. This position is open for undergraduates only. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $10.00 Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
