    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/34125": {
      "title": "Graduate Research Assistant- Disability and Deaf Studies Program",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Graduate Research Assistant- Disability and Deaf Studies Program Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Graduate Research Assistant- Disability and Deaf Studies Program To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20255480V Position Title: Graduate Research Assistant- Disability and Deaf Studies Program Posting Type Student Hours/week: 6 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2025-2026 Academic Year Location St. Augustine Center Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: 1 Department: 134-Education and Counseling Contact Name: Christa Bialka Contact Phone/Extension: (610) 519-4733 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Roles and responsibilities include (but are not limited to): Assisting Dr. Christa Bialka with marketing; conducting focus groups with students to keep an eye toward program improvement; conducting exit interviews; assisting with event construction and promotion. Requirements: Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $18/hr Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a Villanova Graduate student? Yes No * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
