    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/35994": {
      "title": "Technical Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Technical Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Technical Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260316V Position Title: Technical Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: 0-20 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: Unlimited Department: 376 - Student Media Programs Contact Name: Susan Farnam Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-4876 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: VU Tech Crew is Villanova’s on-campus event production group, providing audio, lighting, and video support to various campus events. Our services include setting up speaker systems, providing microphones, mixing live music, programming and running light shows, and putting on livestreams, along with all sorts of other event production work. Requirements: Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: Students are paid per event. (10.00) Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * I understand that satisfactory attendance in all academic classes is required to maintain student employment at Villanova University. Yes No Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents Resume / Curriculum Vitae © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
