    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36192": {
      "title": "Wardrobe Manager",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Wardrobe Manager Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Wardrobe Manager To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260372V Position Title: Wardrobe Manager Posting Type Student Hours/week: 12-20 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Mullen Center Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: 4 Department: 176-Theatre - Winter Contact Name: Rosemarie McKelvey Contact Phone/Extension: 94394 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: IWardrobe Managers oversee and participate in the care and usage of costumes during production. They create and implement costume charts, plot all changes and rehearse changes with actors, and implement this planning while working on all departmental shows. Requirements: Able to work tech weekends (Fri. Sat. and Sun.) and performances on a rotating basis (4 shows a year).Very strong organizational skills, able to work independently, dependability, and sewing abilities. Must be able to use Microsoft Excel Additional Information: Wig and hair experience is a plus. Interest in theatre a plus. Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: 11.25/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability (days, times)? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Resume / Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
