    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/34102": {
      "title": "Graduate Assistant-PBS Department",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Graduate Assistant-PBS Department Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Graduate Assistant-PBS Department To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20255564V Position Title: Graduate Assistant-PBS Department Posting Type Student Hours/week: Up to 15 hours per week Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2025-2026 Academic Year Location Tolentine Hall Detailed Work Schedule Monday through Saturday, 15 hours per week Number of positions: 1 Department: 143-Psychological and Brain Sciences Contact Name: Eileen O'Donnell Contact Phone/Extension: 6105194722 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Role: The Graduate Assistant will provide essential support to the department through a combination of research coordination and administrative responsibilities. Key duties include: Coordinating and proctoring the department’s make-up examinations for undergraduate students. Assisting in the administration of the General Psychology Research Requirement, including communicating with students to guide them through the process of meeting their research requirements and maintaining completion records. Supporting the department chair and administrative staff with a variety of tasks, such as organizing departmental events and facilitating day-to-day operations. Performing ad-hoc research tasks to support various faculty-led research projects. Requirements: Graduate student in the Psychology M.S. program who does not hold a Full Graduate Assistantship. Work-study eligibility preferred but open to all psychology graduate students. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: 15.00/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
