    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/35942": {
      "title": "Front of House Assistant/Ushering",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Front of House Assistant/Ushering Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Front of House Assistant/Ushering To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260306V Position Title: Front of House Assistant/Ushering Posting Type Student Hours/week: 15-20 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Mullen Center Detailed Work Schedule Working Evenings, Weekend Afternoon, Weekend Day & Evenings Number of positions: 15 Department: 824 - Performing Arts Center Contact Name: Tina Sheing Contact Phone/Extension: 6105195006 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Provide Front of House ( FOH ) assistance (e.g. concessionaires, ushers) for MULLEN CENTER performances and events. Maintain knowledge of and positive relationship with University and patrons Assist patron complaints or inquiries. Requirements: Must be an excellent communicator within an academic environment with an ability to instruct, supervise, and clearly explain ticketing and front of house information and procedures to diverse audiences (e.g., creative personnel, undergrad/graduate students, production staff, other University departments, academic departments, and external clients). Excellent customer service skills and proven ability to develop and sustain productive relationships Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Standing for periods of time, some light lifting Wage Rate: $10.00-$13.00 Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): 05/01/2027 Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
