      "title": "General Office Assistants",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | General Office Assistants Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us General Office Assistants To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260073V Position Title: General Office Assistants Posting Type Student Hours/week: 10-12 hours Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Bartley Hall Detailed Work Schedule Monday through Friday from 8:00 am to 5:00 pm. Number of positions: 8 Department: 257-Clay Center Contact Name: Kathy Mongiello Contact Phone/Extension: 9-4333 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Office work of any kind including greeting students, faculty, staff, and guests scheduling appointments, check-in students for appointments, phone coverage, distribution of mail, maintain a clean reception area, etc. Requirements: Good interpersonal skills required. Position requires interaction with students, staff, faculty and guests.  Ability to deal discreetly with sensitive information. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $10.00/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): 06/01/2027 Open Until Filled No Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability (days, times)? (Open Ende