    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36225": {
      "title": "General Office Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | General Office Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us General Office Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260380V Position Title: General Office Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: 10-15 hour Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location St. Augustine Center Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: 2 Department: 147-Theology/Religious Studies Contact Name: Michelle Maloney Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-5246 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Office work of any kind including scheduling appointments, internet research, phone coverage, scanning, reception, mailings, filing, data entry, etc. Requirements: Good interpersonal skills required. Position requires interaction with students & employees. Ability to deal discreetly with sensitive information. Additional Information: Prefer afternoon hours, specifically from 3:30-5:00pm, but flexible. Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $10 Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability (days, times)? (Open Ended Question) * I understand that satisfactory attendance in all academic classes is required to maintain student employment at Villanova University. Yes No Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Resume / Curriculum Vitae © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
