    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/34326": {
      "title": "Mail Services Associate",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Mail Services Associate Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Mail Services Associate To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260088V Position Title: Mail Services Associate Posting Type Student Hours/week: 5-10 Eligibility: Work Study ONLY Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Detailed Work Schedule Monday – Friday 9:00 AM – 6:00 PM and Saturdays 10:00 AM – 2:00 PM; 5-10 Hrs. per week. We can only accept applicants that include your detailed availability within the days/times specified. Number of positions: 15 Department: 405-Campus Mailroom Contact Name: Michael Carter Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-4022 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Work in Mail Services to process mail and packages for Villanova University students, faculty, and staff. Learn and understand Mail Services policies and procedures. Work with package tracking hardware/software to process mail and packages in accordance with Mail Services procedures. Assist at customer service window. Learn and understand package locker reservation systems. Requirements: Additional Information: Only applications that include a detailed work schedule availability will be considered for employment. Upon a recommendation for hire, I-9 documentation is required as part of the HR onboarding process. A list of acceptable documents can be found online. Please note that electronic copies are not acceptable; original, physical documents are required. Physical Demands Summary: Ability to lift and transport 30 lbs. Position requires repetitive motion, and lifting. Wage Rate: 10.00 Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): 09/30/2026 Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability (days, times)? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents Resume / Curriculum Vitae © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
