    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36142": {
      "title": "Peer Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Peer Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Peer Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260359V Position Title: Peer Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: 10 Eligibility: Work Study ONLY Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Kintsuba Hall Detailed Work Schedule Must have FEDERAL WORK - STUDY eligibility (not just student employment) Work Hours: Hours Available: any time onTuesdays: 12:00 – 4:30; Thursdays 12:00 – 4:30; Fridays any time between 8:30 a.m. and 4:30 p.m. Number of positions: 3 Department: 295-Office of Financial Assistance Contact Name: Marykay Klara Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-7933 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Provide support in key areas of customer service and clerical assistance for the office. Duties include: answering phones & returning calls to students and parents, retrieving phone messages from voice mail, greeting visitors to the office and answering general financial aid questions for students and parents; responding to office’s email messages; scanning (will train) Requirements: Only students who have FEDERAL Work-Study as part of their aid package may apply. Wear appropriate attire for office setting. Arrive on/time for shift schedule and obtain a replacement from other office Peers if unable to work a shift. Additional Information: Able to work during fall, winter and spring breaks preferred but not required. Discreet confidentiality a must. Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $10.00 per hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Resume / Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
