    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/34100": {
      "title": "Student Office Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Student Office Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Student Office Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20255562V Position Title: Student Office Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: 10 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2025-2026 Academic Year Location Garey Hall Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: 1 Department: 317-Dept of Global Interdisciplinary Studies Contact Name: Andra Cain Contact Phone/Extension: 6105196302 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: The Student Office & Social Media Assistant will support the department’s outreach and engagement efforts by managing its social media presence, primarily on Instagram. This role involves attending departmental events to capture content, creating and scheduling daily posts and stories, and assisting with general office tasks. The ideal candidate is creative, organized, and enthusiastic about digital communication and growing the department’s social media presence. Requirements: Social Media Content Creation & Management Develop and post engaging daily content (posts, stories, reels) on Instagram. Maintain a consistent visual and editorial style aligned with the department’s branding. Monitor engagement and respond to comments/messages as appropriate. Event Coverage Attend departmental events (e.g., lectures, student gatherings, workshops) to take photos and short videos. Edit and upload event content in a timely manner. Newsletter Assistance Organize and maintain a list of events, faculty highlights, current student spotlight, and alumni news for the GIS Gazette Planning & Strategy Collaborate with staff, faculty, and Assistant Chair for Critical Languages to plan content around academic calendars, events, and announcements. Maintain a content calendar to ensure regular and strategic posting. Office Support Assist with basic administrative tasks such as room booking, data entry, flyer distribution, office maintenance assistance. Qualifications: Strong familiarity with Instagram and basic photo/video editing tools (e.g., Canva, CapCut, iMovie, etc.). Excellent written communication and visual storytelling skills. Ability to work independently and manage time effectively. Availability to attend occasional evening or weekend events. Preferred Skills: Experience with social media analytics and engagement strategies. Photography or videography experience. Interest in academic or student life communications. Additional Information: We are looking for someone who can take our social media with charge and enthusiasm. Initiative is key in this role as there are many moving parts, and it will require the student to be cognizant, think critically, and act with purpose. Physical Demands Summary: Student will be at desk in the Global Interdisciplinary Studies office and/or at GIS and Program events. Wage Rate: 10.00/hr Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability (days, times)? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Resume / Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
