    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36193": {
      "title": "Costume Crew",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Costume Crew Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Costume Crew To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260373V Position Title: Costume Crew Posting Type Student Hours/week: 10-15 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Mullen Center Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: 6 Department: 176-Theatre - Winter Contact Name: Rosemarie McKelvey Contact Phone/Extension: 94394 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Sew costumes, paint shoes, build masks, make hats, cut out fabric from patterns, dye fabrics and jewelry making. Requirements: Must be able to sew, but we will provide training if needed. Must be willing to learn costume construction language. Good communication skills. Ability to work without supervision, dependable, and a sense of humor. Additional Information: Must be available on occasional nights and weekends. FIRST - YEAR STUDENTS PREFERRED . Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $11.25 per hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability (days, times)? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Docum