      "title": "Office assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Office assistant - Physics Office Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Office assistant - Physics Office To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260324V Position Title: Office assistant - Physics Office Posting Type Student Hours/week: 8-10 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Mendel Science Center Detailed Work Schedule Must be available Thursday afternoons Number of positions: 2 Department: 186-Physics Contact Name: Jenn Cooper Contact Phone/Extension: 6105194862 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Office work of any kind including scheduling appointments, internet research, phone coverage, scanning, reception, mailings, filing, data entry, etc. Requirements: Good interpersonal skills required. Position requires interaction with students & employees. Ability to deal discreetly with sensitive information. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $10.00 Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability (days, times)? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents Cover