    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/35859": {
      "title": "Group Fitness Instructor",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Group Fitness Instructor Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Group Fitness Instructor To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260279V Position Title: Group Fitness Instructor Posting Type Student Hours/week: 1- 4 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: N/A Department: 775-Athl - Intramurals Contact Name: Julia Gale Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-6561 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Instructing group fitness classes for a wide variety of fitness levels within the Villanova community. Requirements: A group fitness instructor certification or a more specific certification depending on the class being taught. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Due to the nature of being a group exercise instructor, this person will be working out as part of their job duties which can include various bouts of intense activity. The job also requires some light lifting up to 30 pounds. Wage Rate: $40.00/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability (days, times)? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Resume / Curriculum Vitae © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
