    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36000": {
      "title": "Undergraduate Teaching Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Undergraduate Teaching Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Undergraduate Teaching Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Teachers Assistant for Astrophysics and Planetary Science classes, or for Astrophysics faculty taught MSE courses. Students must be available for lab if instructor requests. Grading is also necessary. Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260322V Position Title: Undergraduate Teaching Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: Approximately 6 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Mendel Science Center Detailed Work Schedule Dependent upon class/lab time assigned. Number of positions: 25 Department: 182-Astronomy and Planetary Science Contact Name: Kathleen DeMara Contact Phone/Extension: 6105194820 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Teachers Assistant for Astrophysics and Planetary Science classes, or for Astrophysics faculty taught MSE courses. Requirements: Must be Astrophysics major. Students must be available for lab if the instructor requests. Grading is necessary. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $13.00 per hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): 08/01/2027 Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * I understand that satisfactory attendance in all academic classes is required to maintain student employment at Villanova University. Yes No Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
