    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36018": {
      "title": "Group Fitness Instructor",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Group Fitness Instructor Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Group Fitness Instructor To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Posting Details (Default Section) Posting Number: 20260039T Position Title: Group Fitness Instructor Position Type: Temp/Intern Location: Villanova, PA Work Schedule: temporary Approximate Number of Hours per Week 2-8 Department: 775-Athl - Intramurals Position Summary: Seeking instructors to teach various group fitness classes to a wide variety of individuals in the Villanova community. Must be able to instruct a variety of modifications during each class in order to meet the needs of beginner, intermediate and more advanced participants. Development and implementation of progressive practice for 12 or so class sessions per semester. Classes will run from late August to early December in the Fall and January to early May in the Spring. Early morning, late afternoon and/or early evening classes available. Flexible scheduling. Duties and Responsibilities: Development and implementation of progressive practice for 12 or so class sessions per semester. Classes will run from late August to early December in the Fall and January to early May in the Spring. Early morning, late afternoon and/or early evening classes available. Flexible scheduling. Minimum Qualifications: Current teaching certification from a reputable organization. Minimum of 1-year teaching experience. Preferred Qualifications: Current CPR / AED /First Aid Certification. Physical Requirements and/or Unusual Work Hours: Special Message to Applicants: EEO Statement Villanova is a Catholic university sponsored by the Augustinian Order. The University is an equal opportunity employer and seeks candidates who understand, respect and can contribute to the University’s mission and values. Posting Date: 07/08/2026 Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Salary Posting Information: Starting salary: $30 per hour Job Classification: non-exempt Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * How did you first hear of this employment opportunity? Indeed.com Higheredjobs.com LinkedIn Glassdoor Chronicle Vitae Academic Keys PA CareerLink/JobGateway Professional Affiliation/Trade Website Diversity Association/Publication Website Advertisement in Academic or Professional Publication Referred by a current employee Referred by a friend, family member, or former employee Heard about it at a conference or career fair Browsing the Villanova website Cabrini University employee Other * If your answer to the above question is \"Other\", please specify the source below. If this question does not apply to you, enter N/A. (Open Ended Question) Documents needed to complete your application: Required Documents Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
