      "title": "Technical Theatre Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Technical Theatre Assistant - Dept Studio Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Technical Theatre Assistant - Dept Studio To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260300V Position Title: Technical Theatre Assistant - Dept Studio Posting Type Student Hours/week: 6 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Mullen Center Detailed Work Schedule Estimated hours- 5 hours per week Dates-8/25 -end of 2026 semester 9:30-11:30am Tuesdays and Thursdays Plus 1 additional work hour per week Number of positions: 1 Department: 146-Theatre Contact Name: Elisa Hibbs Contact Phone/Extension: 94897 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: -Assist in setting up, breaking down, charging, maintaining and securing equipment for on-camera theatre course -Assist instructor in recording student scenes -Assist instructor in splicing, editing, and distributing recorded scenes for student review Requirements: Being familiar with camera equipment-set up, break down, charging, maintaining and securing. Have expertise in recording, splicing and editing material. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Possible carrying, set-up and break-down of camera equipment Wage Rate: $11.25/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): 08/25/2026 Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability (days, times)? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Resume / Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents Letters of Reference (uploaded by applicant) © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
