    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36111": {
      "title": "General Office Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | General Office Assistant - Law Faculty Support Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us General Office Assistant - Law Faculty Support To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below.  If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260351V Position Title: General Office Assistant - Law Faculty Support Posting Type Student Hours/week: 6-10 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Widger Law School Building Detailed Work Schedule We can be flexible about schedule, but hours are available only during business hours (8am-5pm) Monday through Thursday, with required availability on Wednesdays from 12:00 p.m. to 2:00 p.m. Weekly hours will be determined based on departmental needs and student availability. Number of positions: 1-2 Department: 242-Law School Administration Contact Name: Cheryl Baro Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-7003 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: The Law School Faculty Support Office seeks a dependable and detail-oriented student worker to assist with the daily operations and special projects of the office. The student worker will support administrative processes, event coordination, record management, and other activities that help the office provide effective services to law school faculty. This position offers an opportunity to gain professional experience in a collaborative academic environment while developing organizational, communication, and administrative skills. The student worker will contribute to office operations through responsibilities such as the following: Providing administrative support for Faculty Support Office operations. Assisting with document preparation, including copying, scanning, and filing. Supporting the coordination of meetings, workshops, and faculty events. Assisting with data entry and maintaining departmental databases and spreadsheets. Performing general office tasks, including mail distribution, inventory management, and other duties as assigned. Requirements: Good interpersonal and communication skills Service-oriented attitude Strong organizational skills and attention to detail. Ability to work independently and as part of a team Ability to prioritize multiple tasks and meet deadlines. Proficiency in MS Office programs, particularly Microsoft Excel Proficiency with Adobe Acrobat Pro is preferred but not required Prior office or administrative experience is preferred but not required. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $10/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability (days, times)? (Open Ended Question) * What is your class year? Freshman Sophomore Junior Senior None of the above Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Resume / Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved.    800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
